    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῆσις</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρήθω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blowing up, distension,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράχηλος οἰδέει πνεύματος πρήσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντασις καὶ π.</span> (in
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλεός</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῆς π.</span> (in dropsy)
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>; <i>filling out, development,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραχήλου</span> (by gymnastics) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.3
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inflammation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμῶν</span> ibid. (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παρισθμίων, τοῦ ὑπεζωκότος, τοῦ
				πνεύμονος, τῶν νεύρων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
